Vendored helper binaries for hermetic Konflux tasks.

yq-linux-amd64 / yq-linux-arm64
  Copied from quay.io/konflux-ci/yq (same image as YQ_IMAGE in
  .konflux/container_build_args.conf). Used by
  .konflux/scripts/bootstrap-ose-tools-run-script.sh when
  run-opm-pre-actions runs with network isolation on push builds.

Refresh (requires podman + network):
  YQ_AMD64=sha256:72ecc822d08a077c7c22bc783b36b4d79b2dd6abf5bc44f3cf479b562a1d7cef
  YQ_ARM64=sha256:c79eba3385ed9d5fb3c6effaa51c25181f0aef5d9a9a7cf6416fcd25a9292ac3
  for arch in amd64 arm64; do
    digest_var=YQ_${arch^^}
    cid=$(podman create --platform linux/${arch} --entrypoint cat \
      quay.io/konflux-ci/yq@${!digest_var} /usr/bin/yq)
    podman cp "$cid:/usr/bin/yq" "yq-linux-${arch}"
    podman rm "$cid"
  done
